759
01:00:21,367 --> 01:00:22,629
Is that right ?

760
01:00:23,102 --> 01:00:24,091
Yes .

761
01:00:24,203 --> 01:00:26,831
She was feverish . She was delirious .

762
01:00:27,740 --> 01:00:30,140
But I don 't remember her dying ...

763
01:00:30,443 --> 01:00:33,276
