776
01:01:50,790 --> 01:01:52,018
How would she know ?

777
01:01:52,091 --> 01:01:53,353
They know how .

778
01:01:53,493 --> 01:01:56,894
They have charms that can draw a man halfway around the world .

779
01:01:56,996 --> 01:01:59,055
Obeah tricks , magic ...

780
01:01:59,532 --> 01:02:01,056
everybody knows that .

781
01:02:01,134 --> 01:02:03,830
We may have believed all that when we were boys , Wes .

782
01:02:03,903 --> 01:02:06,667
But we 're grown men now . We know it 's all nonsense .

783
01:02:06,739 --> 01:02:07,967
- Do we ? - Yes .

784
01:02:08,074 --> 01:02:10,065
- You 've forgotten ... - I have not forgotten .

785
01:02:10,143 --> 01:02:13,078
I could see what was in your mind when Maxwell was talking .

786
01:02:13,146 --> 01:02:15,512
Just because he didn 't know about Jessica 's coma ...

787
01:02:15,581 --> 01:02:17,549
you thought everything he said was wrong ...

788
01:02:17,617 --> 01:02:19,414
