800
01:02:45,912 --> 01:02:48,278
You better get some sleep , Wes .

801
01:03:05,965 --> 01:03:09,731
Why don 't you go to bed , Wes ? It 's been a hard day for all of us .

802
01:03:15,641 --> 01:03:17,336
I 'm sorry , Wes .

803
01:03:17,577 --> 01:03:19,772
